    "font" : "SFRM1000",
    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "where the last step follows by the facts that |Γ| ≤ ⌈ζλ4 ⌉, λ ∈ (0,1), and ζ ∈ (0,1/2). Now, since σmin(Σh) ≥ λ and sup(x,a)∈X×A ∥ϕh(·,·)∥ ≤ 1 (Assumption H.1), we have that sup(x,a)∈X×A ∥φh(x,a)∥2Σ−1"
  }, {
