    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 71,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 72.0, 210.91, 541.388, 245.221 ],
    "font" : "SFRM1000",
    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "≤ λ4. Therefore, by the definition of Γ, we have that for all ℓ ∈ [0..h−1] and (xℓ,aℓ) ∈ Cℓ, there exists γℓ(xℓ,aℓ) ∈ Γ such that"
  }, {
